sections.content:
With the next statement, we can skip an iteration without terminating the loop:

Example
Skip the value of 3:

 i <- 0
while (i < 6) {
  i <- i + 1
  if (i == 3) {

 next
  }
  print(i)
}

Try it Yourself »

When the loop passes the value 3, it will skip it and continue to loop.

